WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.201
Breaking this morning,

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.103
the leader of Russia's Wagner Group,

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:03.703
the mercenary

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.338
group, says he is pulling his troops out,

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.106
a mood

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.474
that is a key Ukrainian city

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.475
that we've been talking about.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:09.676
They've been trying to capture it

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.145
for months and now has heavy casualties.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:13.213
The leader of this group

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:14.414
is publicly blasting

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:15.782
Russian military leaders,

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.118
accusing them of not supplying his men

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:19.285
with ammunition.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.554
He posted an angry video on social media

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.256
standing next to a pile

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:25.325
of what he says were dead mercenaries.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:26.092
We were warning out

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.227
we have blurred this video,

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.796
but it is still very graphic.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:30.630
Footage.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.132
But there there was fighting.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.199
You drew a cover.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.734
These men here

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.837
who died today are Wagner PMC.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:40.040
Their blood is still fresh.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.509
We do major items to where

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.877
you think you are

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.812
the masters of this life.

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.312
Don't

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:48.748
you think you can dispose of their lives

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:51.618
if you think because you have warehouses

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.219
full of ammunition

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.387
that you have that right.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.023
The man you see there is

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.191
Yevgeny Prigozhin.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:59.859
He is also a powerful oligarch

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:00.994
known as Putin's chef

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.862
because he operates a catering business

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.330
and is very loyal to the Kremlin

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.131
or as one senior.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.533
So he has been openly

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.301
recruiting mercenaries from prisons

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:09.903
including convicted murderers,

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.304
throwing them into the bloody fight

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.439
and by mood with little to

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:13.807
no military training.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.008
Ukrainian forces say

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.843
it is essentially been a meat grinder

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:18.311
for these vulgar fighters

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.112
CNN's senior

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.580
international security correspondent

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.715
Nick Paton Walsh is live in Perugia

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:23.583
in eastern Ukraine.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.150
Nick,

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.452
I wonder how significant

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:28.054
you see this video in this announcement

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.089
from Prigozhin

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:29.856
as given

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.759
you've been covering this for so long

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.161
Yeah.
It is remarkable

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.597
to hear this kind of open statement

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.732
and it's staggering to

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:40.200
imagine that

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.335
by the middle of next week, a group

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.370
which has so publicly talked

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.872
about the vital nature

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.006
of the fight for back

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:48.741
from thousands of lives

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:49.809
of convicts, often

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:51.244
with very little training

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.412
or tactical awareness

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.880
into what you said is

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.547
the meat grinder

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:55.849
is now publicly telling

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:57.117
the Russian Ministry of Defense

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.852
and essentially Vladimir Putin

00:01:58.852 --> 00:01:59.819
that they're out

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.020
by the middle of next week

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.389
just after the very important date

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.024
in the Russian calendar of Victory Day

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:05.992
on May the ninth.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.227
They're saying this sort of

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:08.428
sticking around to be sure

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:09.963
that isn't, quote, spoiled.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.865
That is an extraordinary challenge

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.933
to the Kremlin on the surface

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.301
and certainly suggests

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.070
that the rifts inside

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.271
the Russian military

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:18.738
is different

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:20.540
branches that seem to potentially

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.008
have been healed in recent weeks.

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:23.676
Well, they're way out in the open,

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:24.577
that video.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:25.712
That is a man essentially

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.080
who's brought people to the front line

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.781
and thrown them towards

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:30.750
Ukrainian guns very callously,

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.719
suddenly claiming to have great emotion

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:34.154
for the bodies behind him.

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:35.889
But it is an absolutely

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.190
stark suggestion

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.725
as to the poor condition

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:39.826
of Russian forces

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.594
and the bickering internally

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.663
I have to hold out the possibility

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:45.165
that this might be some bid

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.099
to get the Ukrainians

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:47.167
to rush towards back

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.801
about seeing an opportunity.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:49.502
But I have to say,

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:50.203
this is now

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:51.938
two days three days

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:53.907
of very embarrassing things

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:54.941
for Vladimir Putin.

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:56.709
We have the drones over the Kremlin.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:57.844
Whatever happened there?

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:58.845
In reality,

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.480
it's certainly not a good look

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.182
to have to admit to two drones

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:03.816
flying over the heart of your government

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:04.951
and damaging the roof there

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:06.052
with an explosion.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.587
And now we have a man who's probably

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:09.822
one of the most public figures

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:12.125
of the Russian military saying that

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:13.193
they're going to give up

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:14.327
this deeply symbolic

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:15.862
setting that they've thrown thousands.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:16.563
Remember, recent

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:17.730
US assessments

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.233
suggested 10,000 people may have died

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:22.168
for Russia fighting for this city

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:24.204
since December alone.

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.104
And now here they are

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:26.773
saying all of that will come to nothing

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:27.840
unless they get military

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.275
shells that they believe

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:30.143
Russia is somehow

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.678
holding onto in its warehouses.

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:32.312
It may also be

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:33.680
they're running out of them.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:34.948
Yeah, it's such a good point

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:36.816
you make about how Prigozhin is now

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:38.051
acting like he cares

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:38.818
about their lives,

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:39.586
about their well-being.

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:41.754
When we've seen how they've been treated.

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:42.422
And we should note,

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:42.822
of course,

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:44.824
Dmitry Peskov, the Kremlin spokesperson,

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:45.625
not commenting,

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:46.759
not confirming this so far.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:48.328
We'll see what they say this morning.

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:49.128
Nick Paton Walsh,

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:50.430
thank you for that report. In Ukraine.

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:54.434
Cities across Ukraine are bracing

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:55.868
for another day of missile

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:56.703
and drone strikes

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:57.437
from Russia

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.172
after that suspicious pre-dawn

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:00.707
attack on the Kremlin.

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:02.342
The sound of air raid sirens

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:03.042
and repeated

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:04.277
explosions sent people

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:05.311
running for shelter

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:07.213
in Kiev on Thursday evening.

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:08.481
And then there was this

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:11.951
frightening scene in the capital

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:23.296
that there was actually friendly fire.

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:25.098
A malfunctioning Ukrainian drone

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.899
shot down by keeps Air Force

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:28.968
no casualties. Or injuries reported.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:30.570
Meanwhile, Moscow

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.405
now says that the US directed

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:33.773
the drone attack on the Kremlin

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:34.941
early Wednesday.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:35.842
Russia called it

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:37.143
an assassination attempt

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:39.379
against President Vladimir Putin.

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:40.480
US National Security

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.882
Council spokesperson John Kirby dismissed

00:04:42.882 --> 00:04:45.318
the claim as ridiculous and lies.

